window.products.push({"id":900004,"name":"JSC Gzhel Decorative Candle Stand Openwork Small Candle Holder. Blue&White Porcelain. Gzhel Table Centerpiece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JiLz57A1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This super-thin porcelain candle holder is unbelievably beautiful! It is painted in the classic Gzhel white-blue colors and is covered with a special transparent glaze to protect the paint from the effects of the elements and time.  Coating with a special glaze protects it from time and external influences. All \"Gzhel\" products are hand-painted and therefore each piece is individual and unique. It can be a wonderful kitchen decoration, an addition to your Gzhel collection, or a wonderful gift.  QUALITY MATERIAL - All of the Gzhel items are made from ecologically, lead-free pure porcelain, based on the special recipe, unique to the Gzhel name.  UNIQUE - Artistic painting. All of our Gzhel Porcelain items are meticulously hand-painted with a unique, blue and white Gzhel hues. Using traditional techniques of underglaze and overglaze painting ensures that each piece is one of a kind. Whenever gilding is used, Gzhel applies paint containing 12% pure gold.  CULTURALLY RICH - The word Gzhel (Gzel) or blue and white porcelain, sometimes spelled as \"Gjel\", is known throughout Europe and beyond, and comes only from a picturesque village by the same name, roughly 30 miles southeast of Moscow. The characteristic white-and-blue patterned tableware has been made in the same village since 1818.  This is a special and one of a kind item that is made by an experienced Artisan.  DECORATIVE – Gzhel Porcelain items would be a great addition to any home because of its wonderfully blue and white colors, unique designs, and immense cultural character, and now they are generously presented in a huge variety of product range for the US consumer by STP-Goods.  GIFT - Great gift for Dad, Mom, Friends, Family, Wedding, and everyone who values great and unique craftsmanship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JiLz57A1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JSC Gzhel","source_asin":"B08ZNTKZRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZNTKZRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZNTKZRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
