window.products.push({"id":900035,"name":"Wood Fame Plants of Beautiful Hanging Indoor Art Decor. Real Wood Surrounding Lovely Faux Eucalyptus, Succulents, Greenery in Natural Colors. Adds Lif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fTb+lG19L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"* WOOD PHOTO FRAME WALL HANGINGS perfect for decorating your living room, bedroom, entry way, kitchen, bathroom, office, kid's room, or business. The genuine wood frames and detailed greenery go with any decor to add natural life and energy to your room. This is the fast and easy way to give your room an attractive makeover. * 5 PICTURE FRAME SET in various popular sizes. You get two 7\" frames, one 10\" frame, one A4 8\" x 11\", and one small 6.6\" x 6.6\". Hang them size by side in the arrangement of your choice. Or place them in different areas to outfit your entire home with lovely wood frame plant art. You will wonder how you ever lived without these marvelous accents to make your home more comfortable and relaxing. * REAL DRIED PLANTS and colorful wild flowers modeled after Eucalyptus, popular Succulents, and always favorite greenery. Unlike other sets that are just plain green plants, you get a variety of fun natural colors including yellow, red, blue, purple, and various shades of green plus more. These natural colors can be much more pleasing than even expensive fine art. You will get lots of sincere compliments from friends, family, and guests. * HIGHER QUALITY throughout in all the plants and frames. We include 2 rolls of quality tape for putting together your set. You will notice more vivid colors, greater detail, and real wood craftsmanship. All in affordable wall art that will last for many years of maintenance free enjoyment. No wonder lots of restaurants, doctor's offices, and hotels insist on this art for their rooms. * GREAT GIFT IDEA perfect for birthday, holiday, Christmas, house warming party, or wedding present. Get yours while we have this exceptional custom set in plentiful supply. Many people are stocking up with several sets to fully outfit their home. It's selling fast after being recommended by interior decorators.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fTb+lG19L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TE SIER","source_asin":"B08PHQRV5W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PHQRV5W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PHQRV5W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
