window.products.push({"id":900074,"name":"Christmas Musical Snow Globe Lantern-White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RL0WTRK4L._AC_SL1031_.jpg","description":"【Providing Perfect Christmas Atmosphere】There are two modes of Christmas snow globe. The lighting mode creates a warm festive atmosphere, and the lighting mode + music mode will add joy to your Christmas. In the music mode, 8 Christmas theme songs will be played in a loop. Jingle Bells, We Wish You A Merry Christmas, Silent Night, Deck The Halls, Joy To The World, The First Noel, Hark! The Herald Angel Sing, Oh, Christmas Tree. 【Energy Saving Concept - We Did It】Still worrying about you or your child forgets to turn off the snow globe Christmas, causing energy waste? Our musical snow globes are designed with the latest environmental concept - timed off. The musical snow globe will turn off automatically after 6 hours of operation(If you don't manually turn it off ), and it will automatically turn on after 18 hours. Cycle every 24 hours. 【Easy to Use】The included USB to DC cable allows you to operate snow globes collectibles without batteries. You can also use 3 AA batteries to place them wherever you need them. They are very convenient and easy to use. I believe this elegant Christmas lanterns will be the best Christmas gift for children. 【Best Christmas Decoration】The lighted moving snow effect and the Christmas scene are just stunning. The elegant Christmas lanterns perfectly decorate your dining table, fireplace, Christmas tree. It will be the most eye-catching Christmas decoration, and everyone is immediately attracted to the colorful lights and music. In addition, it can also be used as a child's night light, let the beautiful melody accompany them to sleep, let the warm lights accompany them all night. 【Perfect Christmas Gift Selection】Still worried about choosing a Christmas present for your friends? Let us help you to solve it. It seems have seen a happy and pleasant smile on your kids' faces when they received the Christmas lantern snow globe. For any quality problems with our Christmas musical snow globes, we offer a 365-day return guarantee and a money-back guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RL0WTRK4L._AC_SL1031_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shengsite","source_asin":"B07Y32CLW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y32CLW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y32CLW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
