window.products.push({"id":900115,"name":"Taste of the Stadium","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QOfJork1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 2019 Football season is here and its time for those parties. Whether its high school, college, or the NFL, get your own stadium today! Taste of the Stadium is the first, the premiere snack stadium kit! In development since 2013, it's the perfect solution for any game day or sports themed party. An easy to assemble version of popular snackadiums. A disposable party tray shaped like a stadium, it is uniquely designed with certain features to make it easy for you to have a festive party set-up, anywhere fast. The field is sized for a standard 13\"x9\" pan, or a standard sized sheet cake. Each corner is sized perfectly to hold the standard sized dip, salsa or deli container. Bowls and squares containers fit fine too. Each section of the stands holds a standard sized loaf pan. After you assemble the stadium, add your favorite food choices and you're ready for your family and guests. It fits on a dining table, picnic table or a tailgate. Fully assembled size is 35\"x31\". It’s made of high-quality dense cardboard and bio-degradable. It is lightweight, easy to assemble and food-safe. You can save it for another day, recycle it or throw it away. Taste of the Stadium is perfect for all game day festivities and sports events. And it’s a great way to celebrate a birthday for sports fans of any age. The tray is large enough for the cake, party favors, plates and napkins. We hope you like it. It will be the talk of your party! Food is not included. Assembly is required. Instructions included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91QOfJork1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taste of the Stadium","source_asin":"B01AA1802I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AA1802I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AA1802I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":900116,"name":"BeeGreen Reusable Grocery Bags 6 Pack Foldable Tote Bag For Women w Pouch X-Large 50Lbs Machine Washable Nylon Fabrics Grocery Bags Durable Waterproof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H4htZBfQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DESIGN WITH PRINTS BAGS: Foldable reusable grocery bags available in 6 different animal patterns,rhino,rabbit, cat, elephant, suitable for both men and women. The patterns of resuable shopping bags are designed exclusively. This retro and simple animal style makes our shopping bag a perfect gift for women and girls!Our eco shopping bags can be used for daily shopping or storage, or seaside holidays, travel, camping etc. FOLDABLE CONVENIENT & EASY TO CARRY AROUND: Our reusable grocery bags are foldable, they can be easily folded into the attached pocket-size pouch,so you can carry these grocery bags fold into your purse,backpack,pocket or the glove box of the car,which take up hardly any space.Then you will always have foldable reusable shopping bags with you ,whether you stop by a store on whim or have an unplanned shopping trip. X-LARGE CAPACITY & DURABLE: These reusable grocery bags measures 13.78 *8.27* 1.57 inches, it isvery big which can hold up to 50+ pounds of groceries and replaces 2-3 conventional grocery bags. And these foldable reusable grocery bags are reinforced with bias tape which makes them hold heavy loads safely. Long handles of the reusable foldable shopping bags allow for hand holding or carry on the shoulder for easier carrying, it is a perfect reusable grocery bags for your daily use! RIP-STOP FABRIC & WATERPROOF: These grocery shopping bags are made of 100% RIP-STOP nylon cloth which is ideal fabric for washable grocery shopping bags. It is Lightweight but VERY Sturdy and Resistant to Rips and Water. By reusing reusable grocery bags heavy duty & keeping plastic out of landfills & oceans! MACHINE WASHABLE & ECO-FRIENDLY : By using these kitchen reusable grocery bags instead of plastic bags, you can save your money and reduce environmental pollution. Our reusable bags can be machine washable, this can free your hands and save your time, very conveinent to your life.At the same time, our large reusable shopping bag are more environmentally friendly than ordinary plastic bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91H4htZBfQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeeGreen","source_asin":"B0B8YQYS2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YQYS2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YQYS2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
