window.products.push({"id":900141,"name":"Ellis Curtain Cynthia Floral Stripe Print Tailored Tier Pair Curtains, 68 by 24-Inch, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rDK5NRPWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ellis Curtain Cynthia Floral Stripe Print Tailored Tier Pair of Curtains -Bring beauty and a brand new look into your home decor with the Cynthia Floral Stripe Print Curtain Program. The soft and subtle design is exceptionally beautiful with the fanciful medium scale floral and stripe print. This sophisticated pattern features a range of shades and colors that coordinate easily with a variety of solids, checks, plaids, and stripes without over powering them. Tailored Tier curtains are used to cover the lower portion of your windows or used alone on shorter length window. They are commonly used in bathrooms, bedrooms, kitchens or any other windows where privacy is wanted. Made with 52-percent polyester/48-percent 5-ounce cotton duck fabric creates a smooth draping effect, soft texture and easy maintenance. Each curtain panel is constructed with a 1.5-inch rod pocket, 1-inch header, and 3-inch bottom hem. Sold in pairs (2 Panels) Width is measured overall 68-inches per pair of panels (both 34-inch panels together) Length is measured overall 36-inches from header top (ruffle above the rod pocket) to bottom of panel. Cynthia Tailored Tier Curtains can be combined with coordinating Tailored Pair of Drape Panels, Valances Toss Pillows and Shower Curtain. The Cynthia Floral Stripe Curtain Program coordinates wonderfully with our Ellis Curtain Marcia Floral Vine Print Curtain Program all-available thru Amazon. Machine Washable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rDK5NRPWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cussing Cups","source_asin":"B009PN5BAC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009PN5BAC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009PN5BAC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":900142,"name":"Milk Frother, GOGENGEN 4-in-1 Milk Frother and Steamer,12.5oz/355ml Automatic Hot and Cold Foam Maker and Milk Warmer for Latte, Cappuccinos, Macchiat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718VG-14YML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4-IN-1 FUNCTION MILK FROTHER】: The 4-in-1 milk steamer can be used as a drink mixer, coffee mixer, milk frother, hot chocolate maker or milk tea maker. Having a coffee frother is equivalent to having four types of machines. Enjoy your favorite frothy beverages with a simple push of a button! 【EASY TO USE】:Milk warmer is a great way for beginners to make cute latte art. According to the preferences of hot and cold milk foam touch button, to complete the exquisite taste of excellent creamy foam in 2 minutes, which produces 95% dense foam of longer duration.The electric milk frother has a large capacity of 290mL. 【MATERIAL & COOL TOUCH SHELL】: Our electric frother are made of a food-grade coating, the stainless steel mug is easy to clean and will not be contaminated with odors, easy to clean. Milk foamer frother is a good choice for people who want to save time and heating steps. The exterior and side handle stay cool, even after use, very comfortable and safe handling. 【SAFETY】: Whisper-quiet and compact, our electric milk frother is made according to the highest standards for safety and quality. We've provided a short power cord to reduce any risks of entangling. 【No Hassle】: GOGENGEN Store Guarantee: We love and take pride in our milk frother and we back this up with a lifetime guarantee. （Have the confidence that this frother will last, if there are ever any issues, just contact us and we will make it right）. Order now and be assured that this product will live up to your expectations, guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718VG-14YML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOGENGEN","source_asin":"B0BHZGL5BR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZGL5BR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZGL5BR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
