window.products.push({"id":900148,"name":"KUFUNG Splatter Screen for Frying Pan - Stops Almost 100% of Hot Oil Splash - Stainless Steel Grease Guard Shield and Catcher (9.84 Inch, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71djYRkMJfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ergonomic Stable Design】: The solid stainless steel wire handle keeps your hands away from the heat and is securely attached to 4 points under the rim of the screen. This keeps the screen straight and stable while in use on a pot or pan or while its 3 resting feet are on a stove top or counter top. 【Safe Cooking And Clean Kitchen】: No one wants to get splattered or burned by hot oil or other liquids, especially when you have little kids around. This anti oil pan cover can protect you and your loved ones, and also block grease to help you maintain a clean stovetop and kitchen wall. You and your family will definitely appreciate a grease free kitchen! 【Protects from hot oil and keeps you safe】: Made of 304 grade stainless steel and extra fine mesh, splatter guard stops 99% of splash, lets all the steam out and allows you to watch the cooking process easily. Increased its mesh count by 40% and reinforced the joints to take your kitchen safety to a new level. 【Multiple Uses】: Splatter screens are perfect for use while simmering food, when needing to see and check on the food or at times when the food will get too hot while using a pan lid. The screen will contain the splatter and allow the steam to escape, while the pan and food maintains a stable heat level. The screens are also used for draining and straining pots and pans, to steam vegetables on placed on top of it while cooking or as a cooling rack for cupcakes and cookies. 【Sturdy Long Lasting Construction】: Stainless steel means our skillet cover fryer screen will stand up to heat and abuse for a long time, absorbing sauce and fat. Heavy duty BPA free materials will not rust, discolor, or warp. Easy clean and dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71djYRkMJfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUFUNG","source_asin":"B08W9WCY5V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W9WCY5V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W9WCY5V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
