window.products.push({"id":900175,"name":"Marquis by Waterford Unity Candle Holders with Candles, Set of 3","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CH9ZSCXXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Many weddings include a unity ceremony where the bride and groom, each holding a lit candle, together light a single candle to symbolize that their lives have become one. From the Waterford Marquis Romance collection comes a gift inspired by this ceremony. Crystal unity candle set includes two 4H\" taper holders and one 5H\" pillar candleholder. The set is a beautiful reminder to a couple that they have joined in a lifetime of love and commitment, and it allows them to reenact the ceremony of unity on anniversaries and other special occasions. White tapers and pillar candle are included. Amazon.com Symbolizing the unity between two loved ones, this set makes an ideal present for a wedding or commitment ceremony. The centerpiece of the set is the unity pillar, a crystal candle holder which stands 5-1/2 inches tall and measures 4 inches across, with a raised lip that contains any drips. A creamy white 4-by-3-inch candle is included for the pillar. Also in the set are two four-inch-tall, cut crystal candle holders, for which two nine-inch white tapers are included. As part of the ceremony, each taper can be lit separately and held together to light the unity candle. Waterford and Marquis, two prestigious crystal companies, joined forces in 1991 to create a simpler, more modern design line for today's lifestyles. Crafted in Germany, this set of fine crystal should be washed by hand in moderately hot water with detergent, then dried with a soft cloth to prevent spotting. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CH9ZSCXXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterford","source_asin":"B000068LYV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000068LYV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000068LYV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":900176,"name":"Trina Turk Mirage Paisley Comforter Set, King, Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vhmysq8VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bright colors and bold scale reflect Trina Turk’s optimistic California modern style. Deep mango and rich navy mix with bright turquoise, sunny gold, and crisp white accents in a vibrant paisley print that is sure to add a dynamic, upbeat note to your bedroom décor. The comforter reverses to a graphic navy and white lattice pattern that is the perfect complement to the colorful freeform paisley. Pair with Trina Fiorella cotton print sheeting in blue and white for additional pattern play and accessorize with white on white accent pieces to add textural interest. Emphasize any of the colors in the paisley by adding one of Trina’s colorful embroidered accent pillows for a fun color pop. King comforter set includes: one comforter (96\"x110\") and two shams (21\"x37\").","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vhmysq8VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trina Turk","source_asin":"B07P9W6NBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P9W6NBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P9W6NBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
