window.products.push({"id":900337,"name":"ELIBABA Shredded Memory Foam Pillows for Sleeping - Bamboo Charcoal Firm Bed Pillow Queen Size Set of 1 Pack- Adjustable Loft Pillow for Side Back Sto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uInor2GFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Bamboo charcoal Infusion】Our bamboo pillow is infused with bamboo charcoal which is sustainably sourced to create the healthiest pillow. Bamboo charcoal has four times the absorption rate of normal charcoal with countless tiny holes to effectively absorb odors, moisture, and polluted air particles. This means it’s a powerful element to creating the ideal sleeping environment for sensitive sleepers. 【Adjustable Fill For Every Sleeper】Shredded memory foam pillows are more moldable than traditional memory foam pillows because they have loose chunks of memory foam. The pieces allow the air to pass through easily and move around infusing better flexibility. Besides both the internal sleeve and the plush outer cover are zippered, so you can easily add or remove fill to help you maintain proper sleep posture and spine alignment. 【Quality Memory Foam】We didn't take any shortcuts on the quality of our materials. All of our memory foam has passed the strict regulations of CertiPUR-US. That means you can be confident that our bed pillows meets CertiPUR-US standards for content, emissions, and durability, and has been analyzed by independent, accredited testing laboratories.Our shredded foam comes from our CertiPUR-US solid pieces, not scraps from other products. 【Temperature Regulating】Bamboo charcoal pillows contain bamboo in both the pillowcase and the memory foam. Fibers made of bamboo are hollow and contain small gaps that promote ventilation, which enables the hot air to escape easily, keeping the pillow cool and dry while you forget all your worries and drift into sleep. The pillows are made of memory foam that has been infused with activated bamboo charcoal that dissipates heat effectively. 【Easy to Care】This queen size firm pillow set of 1 measures 20\" x30\". The pillowcase is removable and machine washable. Improving sleeping quality, you should choose professional adjustable pillow. We will help you to gain better sleep and best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uInor2GFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELIBABA","source_asin":"B0B6P6JXGJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900337","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6P6JXGJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6P6JXGJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
