window.products.push({"id":900422,"name":"Stove Top Cover for Electric Stove, 28.5\" × 20.5\"Glass Top Stove Protector with Anti-Slip Coating,Foldable Multipurpose Cooktop Cover,Waterproof and P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7m8bLEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multipurpose Electric Stove Top Protector: The cooktop top cover is made of natural rubber material and can be easily folded. Protect your stove top from scratches, cracked glass. Prevent hard objects from damaging the glass surface. Can also be used as countertop mat, tableware drying mat, washing machine top cover, pastry baking mat, insulating mat, etc. EXTRA SIZE: The glass stove top protector is about 28.5 x 20.5 inches (depending on your choice) and fits most stoves, counters, washers, dryers, etc. When you use the stove as a food preparation or work space, it gives you extra space for a great experience. DESIGN: The electric cooktop cover has a classic black design that matches most cooktops, perfect for decorating your kitchen. There are also 2 hanging holes on the mat, you can hang it on the wall to save space and Protects kitchen walls from oil splashes | Water and oil proof EASY TO CLEAN & DISHWASHER SAFE: Soft premium silicone that folds easily. When the stove cover is stained, you can easily clean it with a damp cloth, or rinse it under water. When the stove lid is difficult to clean, you can easily throw it in the dishwasher. HEAT RESISTANT:Our cooktop mats are heat resistant up to 230° (avoid direct contact with open flames). Allows hot dishes to be placed on the lid and also protects children and pets from accidental burns. Remember to remove the cooktop electric cover before turning on the stove, and use it at least 20 minutes after the stove is turned off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Y7m8bLEvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iChenxl","source_asin":"B09TTD6GV9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900422","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TTD6GV9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TTD6GV9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":900423,"name":"OURASHERO Egg Cups for Soft Boiled Eggs | 2PCS Ceramic Raw Soft Hard Boiled Egg Holders + 1PC Egg Cracker Topper Cutter + 2PCS Spoons | for Breakfast ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vHkcb7ESL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification & Packaging List Material：ceramic and stainless steel Dimension: Egg cup: 2 x 1.97 x 2.17inch Egg cracker topper: 4.1 x 1.37inch Spoon: 6.5 x 1.38inch Package includes: egg cup x 2, egg cracker topper x 1, spoon x 2 Perfect Set These delightful flower and rabbit egg cups will bring a touch of sunshine to the breakfast table and are perfect for everyday use.  They are hand painted for a unique look and feel. Therefore they are ideal to be mixed and matched to be suit for your tastes. The hole or circle of egg shell cutter is just wider than the average tea spoon. The inside edge is a simple rim, smooth and not sharp.  The dome will fit right over any egg, no matter small, medium or large. It will make great egg pudding desserts. The spoons are just perfect to fit for the egg cups when enjoying your egg. Also, you can use them for any other desserts, cakes or coffee. How to Use the Egg Topper 1. Place the egg in an egg cup, with the narrow end of the egg upwards 2. Place the Egg topper on the egg 3. Pull the top part and release it and let it rebound to the topper 4. Remove the topper, leaving your egg with a perfect circular crack. Gently remove the top of egg shell with fingers or knife Warm Tips Before the first use, it is best to wash the them with warm water. They are also suitable for dishwasher when daily use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vHkcb7ESL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OURASHERO","source_asin":"B093BL3DYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900423","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093BL3DYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093BL3DYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
