window.products.push({"id":900533,"name":"Meiyou Handheld Vacuum, Portable Hand Vacuum Cordless with Powerful Cyclonic Suction, Rechargeable 13.5V Li-ion with Quick Charge Tec, Wet & Dry Vac C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R5yvTqcOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After-Sales Service: Meiyou handheld vacuum provides 24-hour customer service. If you have any questions about the products, please feel free to contact us. POWERFUL & CYCLONIC SUCTION：Meiyou cordless handheld vacuum with powerful motor can provide a stable Strong cyclonic suction. This car vacuum can thoroughly clean dust, crumbs, pet hair for your carpets, offices, vehicles. (Note: hand vacuum must be used with a stainless filter). HASSLE-FREE & LIGHTWEIGHT: The portable vacuum weight in at just 2 lbs, small vacuum cleaner supports one-handed operation while reducing strain at your wrist during cleaning, and the vacuum cleaner is easy to transport from room to room, making household cleaning a breeze. 0.4-milliliter dust cup provides a high dust capacity, giving you more time cleaning and less time emptying. SUPERIOR & MULTIPLE PROTECTION：Meiyou vacuum cleaner charging system also offers 3 layers of protections, including over-voltage protection, over-current protection and over-temperature protection to ensure normal use. And the handheld vacuum cordless can fully charge its battery in 3-4 hours and can be used for 25-30 minutes at a time. Meet your daily cleaning. BRIGHT LED LIGHT: The LED light of hand held vacuum is great for cleaning dark corners easily. And it is also easy to clean in the night with the help of the LED light. Amazing hand held vacuum cordless for cleaning pet hair, food debris, paper scraps, cigarette ashes, and so on. Detachable & Washable Filter：Meiyou hand held vacumn cleaners filter is made of Stainless Steel,which is durable and washable with good corrosion resistance and mechanical properties, and the cordless vacuum Approved by CE, RoHS FCC. If you have any problem with your product, pls feel free to contact us via E-mail.Please note that if the suction drops suddenly, pls check if the filter is completely dried after cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R5yvTqcOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meiyou","source_asin":"B0899PBW3H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0899PBW3H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0899PBW3H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":900534,"name":"Fair Trade Ghana Bolga African Hand Fan 10-12\" Across","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OQZ-iqh4L._AC_.jpg","description":"You will receive a fan of similar colors to this one pictured, but please keep in mind every basket is uniquely handwoven and differs in design. Weavers in the Bolgatanga region of Ghana use the abundant Veta vera grass to weave these incredibly hardy, useful hand fans. Please note that if color looks black on your screen, it is actually a very, very dark blue. Easily reshape your basket by quickly submerging in water, reshape by hand and hang to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51OQZ-iqh4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baskets of Africa","source_asin":"B00CFPMVT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CFPMVT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CFPMVT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
