window.products.push({"id":900552,"name":"Five Nights at Freddy's Kids Bedding Comforter and Sheet Set, 4 Piece Twin Size, by Franco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XKHfVib0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fantasy and fun come to life in this brightly colored bedding set featuring sixth generation characters from the popular Five Nights at Freddy’s computer game. Fans of the Scott Games franchise will be thrilled with the bold character imagery and iconic FNAF phrases pictured on this cozy comforter and sheet set. Characters Foxy, Chicca, Golden Freddy, Freddy and Bonnie are boldly depicted on a checkerboard background on one side of this soft microfiber comforter. When the animatronics come to life, simply flip the comforter over to reveal a colorful print of FNAF phrases on a bright blue background. Whichever side is displayed, this comforter brings some serious style to the bedroom of any Five Nights at Freddy’s fan. The bedding set includes a grey checkered fitted sheet with an all-over print of the late-night crew Freddy, Bonnie, Chicca and Foxy, a flat blue checkered sheet with an all-over print of the famous Freddy’s Pizza light-up sign, and a double-side pillow case with the all four characters on one side and Freddy on the other. Even with the jump scares and creepy animatronic characters, it would be easy to survive five nights at Freddy’s with this cozy set to cuddle up with. Bring the thrills of the hit Scott Games computer game home with this stylish bedding. A great way to add some fun and excitement to their bedroom décor, this Five Night’s at Freddy’s bed set will give their room a frightful look they’ll love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XKHfVib0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Franco","source_asin":"B07PSDCTJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900552","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PSDCTJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PSDCTJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":900553,"name":"Pure Egyptian King Size Cotton Bed Sheets Set (King, 1000 Thread Count) Sea Foam Bedding and Pillow Cases (4 Pc) – Egyptian Cotton Sheets King Size Be","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812E9f7HmAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top Quality Egyptian Cotton Sheets King: Our Sea Foam, king sheets deep pocket are as soft and comfortable as it gets and will have you sleeping like a baby. These deep pocket sheets king are Standard 100 by OEKO-TEX, leaving no worries of thread count & performance. 1000 Thread Count, Deep Pocket Sheets (4 Piece Set): These luxurious, 1000 thread count sheets king come with a flat sheet (102” x 108”), a deep fitted sheets king size (78” x 80” x 15”) with an all-around elastic that fits an 15” deep mattress, & a pair of 20 x 40” pillowcases. Silky Soft Sheets! These Egyptian cotton sheets set are made from pure Egyptian cotton which is renowned for its softness and durability. These are sateen weave sheets that offer a lavish look to the room a great night’s sleep to you! Our king Sea Foam sheet set, will make you feel like you are on cloud 9, literally! Anti-Pilling & Fade Resistant: Our Sea Foam sateen sheets king size sets use top quality anti-pilling and fade resistant yarns. We believe you deserve the best. Why risk it with other Sea Foam sheets king size that itch and fade in the wash? Here at Thread Spread, we are devoted to serving you with the best sheets possible! In the unlikely scenario of rising quality issues, you can directly write to us so we can address your problems best and on top priority. We also offer our customers a 30 day return and refund policy if they find they are unhappy with the product. Care Guidance: Machine wash our 100% cotton king size sheets in warm and tumble dry on low, do not bleach. When machine drying, do not dry at high temperatures. For bed linens it is important to remove from dryer before completely dry, gently fold then iron, if needed. Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812E9f7HmAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B07Q81SN6H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900553","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q81SN6H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q81SN6H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
