window.products.push({"id":900597,"name":"Normcore 54mm Double Spout Portafilter with Basket - Anodized Aluminum Handle and Basket Removal Tool - Fit 54mm Breville/Sage Machines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fZVs8-X-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed to fit baskets of 54mm diameter, they're fully compatible with many of the Breville Barista Pro and Breville Barista Espresso Machine models. A bottomless portafilter is an important piece of equipment that aids in diagnosing espresso extraction issues. The spouts are removed, and the basket is exposed, allowing you to watch the entire extraction process. The Bottomless Portafilter sometimes referred to as a Naked Portafilter has become an essential addition to any quality-orientated espresso shop's barista tools. Our bottomless portafilters are made from 304 stainless steel and Aluminum alloy handle. Breville 54mm - Fits the Barista Pro, BES878, Barista Express, BES870XL, the Infuser, BES840XL, and the Duo-Temp BES810BSS. PLEASE NOTE: Channeling and spurting can be very messy, but are EXTREMELY common. This is not a defect of the portafilter itself, but instead, is your coffee telling you that there's room for improvement in your preparation process (grind size, tamping, distribution, etc.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fZVs8-X-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Normcore","source_asin":"B0BFWHWTQL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFWHWTQL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFWHWTQL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
