window.products.push({"id":900902,"name":"Corelle Hearthstone Stoneware Round 16-Piece Set, Service for 4, Tumeric Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412YQ243CQL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Corelle Hearthstone Stoneware Round 16-Piece Set, Service for 4,includes 4-each 10-1/2-inch Dinner Plates, 7-1/2-inch Luncheon Plates,20-ounce Soup/Cereal Bowls, 14-ounce Mugs, Turmeric Yellow Amazon.com Hearthstone dinnerware from Corelle sets a vibrant table with color choices from its Spice Alley collection. Choose from Chili Red, Turmeric Yellow, Bay Leaf Green, Indigo Blue, or Royal White, and mix and match if desired. Clean-lined and modern, the round pieces take their cue from Asian styling for a refined, timeless look. The backs of the plates, interior of the mug, and exterior of the soup bowl are black for sophisticated contrast to the intense colors. A square version of Hearthstone is also available for further customizing your table. Ready right out of the box to seat four diners, this set includes four of each of the following: 10-1/2-inch dinner plate; 7-1/2-inch luncheon, salad, or dessert plate; 20-ounce bowl for soup, cereal, or ice cream; and a 14-ounce mug. Corelle makes the glossy dinnerware of durable stoneware that stands up to everyday use in the microwave and dishwasher, with the added bonus of being oven-safe for keeping food warm. The set is covered by Corelle's one-year replacement policy for any piece that chips or breaks during normal household use. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 10-1/2-inch dinner plate; 7-1/2-inch salad plate; 20-ounce soup/cereal bowl; 14-ounce mug. 16 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412YQ243CQL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Corelle","source_asin":"B000EGI08O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-900902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EGI08O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EGI08O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
